       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DFSORTST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. GG
           PROGRAM COLLATING SEQUENCE IS EB.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           ALPHABET EB IS EBCDIC.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT I1-FILE ASSIGN TO SORTIN1.
           SELECT I2-FILE ASSIGN TO SORTIN2.
           SELECT O-FILE ASSIGN TO SORTOUT.
           SELECT S-FILE ASSIGN TO SORTWK01.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  I1-FILE.
       01  I1-REC PIC X(350).
       FD  I2-FILE.
       01  I2-REC PIC X(350).
       FD  O-FILE.
       01  O-REC PIC X(350).
       SD  S-FILE.
       01  S-REC PIC X(350).
       01  K1-R.
           05 K1 PIC X(16).
           05 FILLER PIC X(334).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  W-EOF PIC X.
       01  W-REC PIC X(350).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           SORT S-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY K1
               USING I1-FILE I2-FILE
               GIVING O-FILE
           GOBACK.
